who's a bit stern.

289
00:15:07,260 --> 00:15:08,130
What do you think?

290
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:09,150
Stern?

291
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:10,800
- Yeah.
- What the fuck do I do now?

292
00:15:12,900 --> 00:15:13,560
Hey!

293
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:16,240
Anyone who has an issue with me,

294
00:15:16,590 --> 00:15:17,480
