295
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,350
What are you laughing at?

296
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:24,130
- I'm gonna hit you in the head...
- Whoa.

297
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:25,120
Jaab.

298
00:15:25,170 --> 00:15:27,000
It's me, Jane. Your brother.

299
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,550
Oh, sorry. I forgot.

300
00:15:34,020 --> 00:15:34,960
Thank you.

301
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:37,280
Huh? For what?

302
00:15:38,410 --> 00:15:39,850
You never stress me out

303
00:15:40,210 --> 00:15:42,040
whenever you're around.

304
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:03,580
Do you know that...

305
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:04,840
they call these

306
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:07,320
