307
00:16:09,610 --> 00:16:11,640
You mean these dimples?

308
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:12,560
Mm.

309
00:16:12,930 --> 00:16:15,320
They say those who have dimples
are good people.

310
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:17,850
An angel adored you, so she kissed you
before you were born.

311
00:16:19,140 --> 00:16:20,140
Really?

312
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:20,970
Mm.

313
00:16:23,470 --> 00:16:24,150
And...

314
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,230
