319
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:34,000
Do you have them? Let me see.

320
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,740
Where are they?

321
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:45,320
Please, Jaab. Show me.

322
00:16:45,660 --> 00:16:47,330
Please? Where? Where are they?

323
00:16:47,350 --> 00:16:49,040
