324
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:53,040
There!

325
00:16:53,530 --> 00:16:55,760
You also have a kiss from an angel.

326
00:16:56,050 --> 00:16:56,730
Here.

327
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:58,080
It's just as soft.

328
00:16:59,730 --> 00:17:01,220
It's indented, huh?

329
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:03,840
Jane.

330
