I've seen some of the ads he directed
while I was watching soap operas.

350
00:18:47,030 --> 00:18:48,920
I never knew those were his work.

351
00:18:51,350 --> 00:18:53,220
Not only is he good at his job,

352
00:18:53,430 --> 00:18:55,400
but he's also great with people.

353
00:18:57,030 --> 00:18:58,030
Like...

354
