384
00:20:31,050 --> 00:20:32,340
- Mm.
- Right.

385
00:20:35,550 --> 00:20:37,250
Take care of yourself.

386
00:20:37,270 --> 00:20:38,520
I will.

387
00:20:43,990 --> 00:20:45,120
Master Jaab.

388
00:20:45,230 --> 00:20:45,840
Yes?

389
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:48,480
Yes, you. Come here.

390
00:20:50,230 --> 00:20:51,330
Me too?

391
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:53,080
- Yes, Master Jaab. Come here.

392
00:20:58,360 --> 00:21:01,280
Lend me a hand again
the next time you're here, okay?

393
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:03,730
Of course, Auntie Kaew.

394
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:04,750
Next time,

395
00:21:05,850 --> 00:21:09,320
