409
00:21:38,620 --> 00:21:40,440
Don't forget to put on your seatbelts.

410
00:21:40,460 --> 00:21:41,320
- Yes.
- Alright.

411
00:21:47,540 --> 00:21:48,940
Bye-bye.

412
00:22:06,050 --> 00:22:08,130
