It's dry and clean now.

425
00:22:52,230 --> 00:22:53,240
Inside?

426
00:22:57,020 --> 00:22:59,230
Sure! Of course, Jane.

427
00:22:59,250 --> 00:22:59,980
I'll...

428
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:08,080
