429
00:23:21,450 --> 00:23:22,640
- Here.
- Whoa!

430
00:23:25,150 --> 00:23:26,110
Oh.

431
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,720
Thank you, Jane.

432
00:23:29,740 --> 00:23:31,720
Oh, it smells really nice.

433
00:23:31,750 --> 00:23:33,640
I guess I should go now.

434
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:35,440
Wait.

435
00:23:40,330 --> 00:23:42,030
What... What is it, Jane?

436
00:23:42,740 --> 00:23:43,740
Aren't you gonna drink
some water?

437
00:23:44,630 --> 00:23:45,630
Drink...

438
00:23:45,650 --> 00:23:46,630
Oh.

439
00:23:46,830 --> 00:23:48,050
Oh, I...

440
00:23:48,450 --> 00:23:49,510
I already had some water
on the drive here.

441
00:23:50,700 --> 00:23:51,890
All done. Then, I...

442
00:23:51,910 --> 00:23:53,400
I'm gonna go now.

443
00:23:54,540 --> 00:23:57,680
Jane... Why did you get up?

444
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:59,050
To send you off, obviously.

445
00:24:00,130 --> 00:24:01,740
Oh, to send me off.

446
00:24:02,930 --> 00:24:04,630
It's okay, Jane. Uh...

447
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:06,160
My car.

448
00:24:06,570 --> 00:24:07,640
I parked it at the front.

449
00:24:07,660 --> 00:24:09,260
It's right next to the elevator.

450
00:24:09,280 --> 00:24:10,840
