451
00:24:30,320 --> 00:24:31,930
You don't need a key card to go down.

452
00:24:31,950 --> 00:24:33,400
Press G and you're good to go.

453
00:24:33,520 --> 00:24:34,520
Okay.

454
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:37,360
Jane.

455
00:24:37,870 --> 00:24:38,640
Hm?

456
00:24:38,660 --> 00:24:40,080
Thank you for...

457
00:24:40,840 --> 00:24:41,920
bringing me to your house.

458
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:43,960
