461
00:24:48,860 --> 00:24:51,830
Whoa, don't just say that.

462
00:24:52,120 --> 00:24:53,680
I'll go if you say so.

463
00:24:56,840 --> 00:24:57,920
I'm being serious.

464
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:06,720
Okay.

465
00:25:07,220 --> 00:25:08,200
It's a deal, then.

466
00:25:08,630 --> 00:25:09,960
Well...

467
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:11,880
Tell me when you're back at your condo.

468
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:15,040
Drive safely.

469
00:25:15,060 --> 00:25:15,920
Bye.

470
00:25:31,050 --> 00:25:31,920
Am I...

471
00:25:33,040 --> 00:25:34,640
Do I really like Jane?

472
00:25:35,730 --> 00:25:37,050
Do I like Jane...?

473
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:41,480
Do I actually like him?

474
00:25:48,400 --> 00:25:50,040
Yeah, I do. I like Jane.

475
00:25:54,730 --> 00:25:56,210
See? I told you.

476
00:25:56,230 --> 00:25:57,180
Yeah.

477
00:25:57,200 --> 00:25:59,150
I can see actual hearts in his eyes, Mek.

478
00:25:59,820 --> 00:26:01,360
You're right.

479
00:26:01,650 --> 00:26:03,680
There are hearts everywhere.

480
00:26:04,830 --> 00:26:07,400
Give us a quick recap.
What happened in Phetchabun?

481
00:26:08,720 --> 00:26:10,160
What happened there...?

482
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:11,840
Well...

483
00:26:12,620 --> 00:26:15,480
The trip was full of cuteness!

484
00:26:15,570 --> 00:26:16,480
Ugh...

485
00:26:17,890 --> 00:26:18,760
What the hell?

486
00:26:19,030 --> 00:26:19,850
Guys!

487
00:26:19,870 --> 00:26:20,480
