500
00:27:10,220 --> 00:27:11,520
What the fuck were you
dreaming about, handsome?

501
00:27:12,430 --> 00:27:13,640
Why the fuck are you sitting here?

502
00:27:13,660 --> 00:27:15,520
Well, Jane isn't here yet.

503
00:27:15,650 --> 00:27:17,180
Can't I just have a moment
with you first?

504
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:19,030
A moment, my ass. You're creepy!

505
00:27:19,650 --> 00:27:22,440
Well, when are you making your first move?

506
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:25,070
