514
00:28:02,520 --> 00:28:04,840
Okay. I won't say that you like Jane again.

515
00:28:05,700 --> 00:28:06,550
Damn it, Pun.

516
00:28:06,570 --> 00:28:07,760
While I was telling you to shut up,

517
00:28:07,780 --> 00:28:09,880
