Do you know that, bastard?!

518
00:28:11,340 --> 00:28:12,410
Uh, but...

519
00:28:12,430 --> 00:28:15,440
The more people know about this,
the better it is for you, isn't that right?

520
00:28:15,540 --> 00:28:16,720
Better, my ass.

521
00:28:16,740 --> 00:28:17,720
Jane will feel uncomfortable.

522
00:28:18,630 --> 00:28:20,850
But you're making a move on him, no?

523
00:28:20,870 --> 00:28:23,400
