530
00:28:37,850 --> 00:28:39,480
Um... A chicken?

531
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:41,350
- Khanoon, buddy!
- Ow, what is it?

532
00:28:41,370 --> 00:28:42,230
Chicken, my ass.

533
00:28:42,250 --> 00:28:43,480
Damn it.

534
00:28:44,840 --> 00:28:45,840
